      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b38774/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-02-07T05:17:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><font face=\"&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;HelveticaNeue&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"3\">The background on the production issues was enlightening. Each time a new issue cropped up with factory or shipping or costs it must have been disheartening. I am sure GTG did the best that could be done to deliver a quality game in as timely a manner as possible.<br>\n<br>\nR<span>egarding Prime War in July last year you advised that by the fall the updates should be monthly just like a Kickstarter. What are your plans for more detailed updates on Prime War in the future?</span></font></font></p>",
