      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/bbe5ce/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-02-12T00:23:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wow - the box problems were pretty brutal! It's amazing just how many problems boxes cause, so I can see why Chris Kirkman was so vehement about having box sizes that fit the game in a pretty snug fashion. As someone who sleeves, I find the DHM boxes a bit too small, but I can't complain about the company not wanting to ship and store air, especially in light of the change in shipping policies. Just glad I've got my monster box for sentinels, even if the weight of it terrifies my shelves...</p>",
